{
  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.21333300000000002,
      "end": 0.973333,
      "text": "I used to spend 30"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.973333,
      "end": 2.173333,
      "text": "minutes every single morning trying"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.173333,
      "end": 3.033333,
      "text": "to figure out what my"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.033333,
      "end": 3.753333,
      "text": "priorities were."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.826667,
      "end": 4.446667000000001,
      "text": "And to be honest with"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.446667000000001,
      "end": 5.106667000000001,
      "text": "you, it made me feel"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.106667000000001,
      "end": 6.146667000000001,
      "text": "behind before the day had"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.146667000000001,
      "end": 6.8266670000000005,
      "text": "even started."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.933333,
      "end": 7.993333,
      "text": "But then I built an"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.993333,
      "end": 9.053333,
      "text": "AI OS."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.120000000000001,
      "end": 9.72,
      "text": "Think of it like my"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.72,
      "end": 11.0,
      "text": "own JARVIS from Iron Man,"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.1,
      "end": 12.38,
      "text": "a personalized AI system that"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.38,
      "end": 13.12,
      "text": "understands me"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.280000000000001,
      "end": 13.86,
      "text": "and my work,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.02,
      "end": 14.92,
      "text": "remembers what's important,"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.06,
      "end": 15.84,
      "text": "and helps me manage my"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.84,
      "end": 16.92,
      "text": "tasks, my appointments,"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.92,
      "end": 18.419999999999998,
      "text": "my decisions, and my workflows."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.526667,
      "end": 19.666667,
      "text": "And now, instead of digging"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.666667,
      "end": 20.666666999999997,
      "text": "through my task list,"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.786667,
      "end": 22.006666999999997,
      "text": "my calendar, and my messages,"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.206667,
      "end": 22.806667,
      "text": "I can see what needs"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.806667,
      "end": 23.586667000000002,
      "text": "my attention, and I can"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.586667000000002,
      "end": 24.466666999999998,
      "text": "just get straight to work."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.633333,
      "end": 25.353333,
      "text": "So if you've been feeling"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.353333,
      "end": 26.393333000000002,
      "text": "scattered, this is what you"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.393333000000002,
      "end": 26.693333,
      "text": "need."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.753333,
      "end": 27.473333,
      "text": "It's like having your own"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.473333,
      "end": 28.893333000000002,
      "text": "executive assistant helping you manage"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.893333000000002,
      "end": 29.413332999999998,
      "text": "your life."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.5,
      "end": 30.06,
      "text": "And if you'd like help"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.06,
